N.B. the database schema should be managed by Alembic to support schema migrations of a live database. Currently the SQLAlchemy models fully capture the schema represented by the files in this directory.

This directory contains the schema for the scheduler.. It is primarily intended for reproduction of a development database not schema migrations of a live database. It will only work for building the new database out of the old database.

The unsafe-reprovision-db.sh command included will destroy the database and recreate it.

The historical data is required for creating the development database and is not included in the repo. You must overwrite the various syntheticfiles that are used as placeholders in this directory such 003-import-data.sql.

The generate-schemapdf.sh command turns schema.er into a pdf of a simplified ER diagram using the erd tool. If it is not installed the script will not run.
